[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0010","text":"哇……\n好有格调的空间……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0020","text":"光线有点暗暗的……\n吧台也，好有氛围～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0030","text":"嗯呵呵……\n怎么回事，说话声音自然而然地就变小了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0040","text":"哈哈……这种感觉我懂"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0050","text":"──进这家店，我其实有点紧张来着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0060","text":"有制作人陪着我，感觉安心多了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0070","text":"能帮上忙就好\n我倒现在还有点紧张呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0080","text":"完全看不出来呀～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0090","text":"……还有，再多一点时间吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0100","text":"嗯，没问题\n慢慢享受吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30400400_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
